  "description": "Pure licensing/entitlement contract shared by IdentityService, taf_crud and taf_infra: the persisted smallint\n      enums, the subscription/package-version/invoice state machines that guard every status transition, and the\n      access-semantics map. Deliberately dependency-free (no EF, no MassTransit, no CRUD) so any service can reference it.",
  "id": "TAF.Infra.Licensing",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-04T11:52:29.057Z",
